cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository reproduces the sensitivity figures (Sec. IV) of the GRENDEL v2 paper. If you use it, please cite
  the paper (preferred-citation) and the analysis code it runs, grendel-sensitivity, whose CITATION.cff
  (src/grendel-sensitivity/CITATION.cff) names every tool the results rest on.
type: software
title: "grendel-sensitivity: the GRENDEL analysis code (v2.5.0) and the from-scratch reproduction of the sensitivity figures of the GRENDEL v2 paper"
authors:
  - family-names: Redi
    given-names: Federico Leo
    affiliation: "Università degli Studi di Bergamo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/exoticdarksectors/grendel-sensitivity"
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - long-lived particles
  - heavy neutral leptons
  - dark scalar
  - axion-like particles
  - HL-LHC
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "Proposing GRENDEL: GalleRy ExperimeNt for Decays of Exotic LLPs at the LHC"
  authors:
